# Findings deliberately accepted, with the reason. Review this file rather than
# growing it: an entry here is a decision, not a silence.

# DS-0002 — "Specify at least 1 USER command in Dockerfile".
# The image has no USER instruction on purpose. It starts as root only to chown
# the /data mount point, which a Docker host may have created as root, and then
# drops to MANTEL_PUID:MANTEL_PGID (default 10001:10001) with su-exec before
# exec'ing the server. A UID of 0 is rejected outright, and the container drops
# every capability. See scripts/docker-entrypoint.sh.
DS-0002
